# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What is deliberately NOT ignored here.
#
# Authoritative documentation SOURCE is tracked: the Markdown documents, the manual generator and
# the website sources all live in the repository. Ignoring them would mean a fresh clone produced a
# plugin with no manual, no API reference and no installation guide, and nobody could check the
# shipped documentation against the commit it came from.
#
# Only genuinely generated or machine-local output is ignored, and each entry below says which it
# is. Scripts/Validate-Documentation.ps1 covers the half that ignore rules cannot: keeping the
# documentation in agreement with the implementation.
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Generated documentation output ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerated at release time from the tracked sources beside them
# (Docs/USER_MANUAL_SOURCE.md + Docs/build_user_manual.py). The release manifest records their
# hashes; Validate-Documentation.ps1 fails the release when the rendered PDF is older than its
# inputs.
Docs/*.pdf

# --- Release validation evidence --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build logs, packaged-host smoke results, performance JSON, traces and manifests. Reproducible by
# re-running the pipeline, and deliberately kept out of the plugin release archive.
Artifacts/

# --- Unreal build output ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Note that BuildPlugin PRODUCES an Intermediate/Build tree inside its package output, and that one
# IS shipped: it carries the precompiled metadata Blueprint-only users need in order to package
# without a compiler. This entry is about the working tree, not the archive.
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
Tests/*/Binaries/
Tests/*/Intermediate/
Tests/*/Saved/
Tests/*/DerivedDataCache/

# --- Release artefacts -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.zip
release-manifest-*.json

# --- IDE and OS ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
*.VC.db
*.opendb
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

**/.claude/settings.local.json